<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Souza Cruz on hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Souza Cruz on hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Local investment bank Banco Omega said it was maintaining its hold recommendation for Brazilian tobacco company Souza Cruz.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We recommend that Souza Cruz common shares be put on hold given that the market price already reflects a good portion of the company's upside potentials,&quot; the bank said in a report.</p>
<p>-- Souza Cruz common stock was traded at 7.14 reais, down 0.27 percent at 1620 local/1920 GMT on the Sao Paulo bourse.</p>
<p>-- Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo newsroom, 55-11-2324411</p>
</text>
